.TH KINTSUGI-REPORT 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-report \- findings report
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi report
[\-\-out <file>]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate a plain-text findings report including findings, telemetry, and quota.
.SH OPTIONS
.IP \fB\-\-out\fR
Output file (default stdout)
.SH EXAMPLES
Print report:
.PP
  $ kintsugi report
.PP
Save to file:
.PP
  $ kintsugi report --out report.txt
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1)
